<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CFM Technologies said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CFM Technologies said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber raised its rating of CFM Technologies Inc to buy from attractive on Wednesday, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 30 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
